explain.text:
It is the running maximum turned round: start from the first value and replace it with anything smaller. Starting at 0 would wrongly return 0 for a day of gains.

```python
def worst_day(pnls):
    worst = None
    if len(pnls) > 0:
        worst = pnls[0]
        for p in pnls:
            if p < worst:
                worst = p
    return worst
```

